window.products.push({"id":769049,"name":"(12 Pack) Patriotic July 4th USA Top Hats for Adults and Kids","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/716hA-WP+BL._AC_UL1500_.jpg","description":"FASHION AND PATRIOTISM ALL IN ONE. | Show your love for our great country--and look great doing it. When you put on our Patriotic July 4th USA Top Hats for Adults and Kids, it’s like waving the American flag, only your hands are free to enjoy the 4th of July backyard party barbecue. Our American flag hats are made of white plastic, and each top hat features vertical red stripes, horizontal white stripes, and white stars. LET THE FIREWORKS BEGIN! | 4th of July is the best holiday of the year. Summer is in full swing, it's nice and warm--time to fire up that BBQ! Throw on some burgers (or veggie burgers), ice up the beer, and get ready for fireworks. Our American flag top hats are great as party favors. Wearing them shows everyone that the spirit of Independence Day remains with you--even after downing a case of beer. UNCLE SAM WANTS YOU… | For the US Army, yes, to pay your taxes, oh yeah, but also to have a great time! Be sure to add our top hat for men and women to your 4th of July party supplies. Uncle Sam’s been to his share of parties. He knows that as Independence Day gets closer--these USA hats will go quickly! Be sure to get yours today. BASED IN THE USA | We’re proud to be a US based, family owned company that’s been in business since 1983. Our passion is to always provide you with the best selection of unique gifts and novelties on the market. NCLUDED: (1) 12-Pack of Patriotic July 4th USA Top Hats for Adults and Kids","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/716hA-WP+BL._AC_UL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Windy City Novelties","source_asin":"B002C1FTB0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-769049","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B002C1FTB0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B002C1FTB0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":769050,"name":"Pacific Merchants K0425 Acaciaware 8- by 5- by 1.5-Inch Acacia Wood Rectangle Serving Tray","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.83,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LHduvx0BL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Acaciaware, by Pacific Merchants, is the highest quality and best valued Acacia woodenware available on the market; the bowls are hand turned from one solid piece of Acacia hardwood and the serving pieces are hand carved, making each one a unique, sculptured work of art. Acaciaware is a dense, naturally resinous hardwood which, by its very nature, resists penetration by water and will not absorb stains or odors. Use the Acaciaware Rectangle Tray every day and use it on special occasions – the exquisite craftsmanship, gorgeous color and natural design will make a special occasion out of any occasion. Acaciaware also means easy care. Hand wash with warm soapy water and air dry. It doesn’t typically require oil but, if for some reason it appears to be drying out, simply use a non-toxic mineral oil to restore the wood grain to its original beauty. Creating high quality woodenware is not Pacific Merchants only concern, they are also concerned about the environment. Their wood sources do not harm the environment by using slash and burn methods of harvesting trees. All of their wood is harvested with care meaning that the trees they use are harvested legally from privately owned lands, which are highly regulated and monitored by the government. Pacific Merchants cares about sustaining the environment and are constantly looking for wood sources. Acaciaware Rectangle Tray. Overall, tray measures 8-1/2 by 5 by 1-1/2.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LHduvx0BL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PACIFIC MERCHANTS","source_asin":"B001TH8988","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-769050","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B001TH8988","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B001TH8988","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
