window.products.push({"id":769118,"name":"Hallmark Keepsake Christmas Ornament 2019 Year Dated Looney Tunes Tasmanian Motion, Tornado Taz","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.51,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qV0K2lIbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"It's hard to say what will set off the wild-eyed Tasmanian Devil, but Looney Tunes fans love to laugh at his fury. Pull the cord on this Christmas tree ornament to watch Taz spin wildly, carving a path through every obstacle in his way. A must-have for fans of the short-tempered tornado. Magic Motion Christmas tree ornament. Pull the cord to see Taz spin. No batteries required. Artist crafted by Robert Chad, this Christmas tree ornament comes pre-packaged in a box for easy gift giving, preservation and storage. Dated 2019 in copyright. With unparalleled artistry and exceptional detail, each festive and collectible Keepsake Ornament is made for years of celebrations. From preserving precious memories to commemorating special milestones and interests, there's a Hallmark ornament for everyone on your gift list. Hallmark has been your family-owned creator of greeting cards, gifts, gift wrap and more for over 100 years. We take deep pride in helping individuals connect in just the right way. Plastic Christmas tree ornament is lead-free and measures 2.65\" W x 3.9\" H x 2.62\" D.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qV0K2lIbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hallmark Keepsake","source_asin":"B07NDG79VN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-769118","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07NDG79VN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07NDG79VN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
