window.products.push({"id":769166,"name":"HOWOFURN 24x36 Rectangular Bathroom Mirror, Wall Mirror for Bathroom, Wall Mount Mirror, Metal Frame, Built-in Gourd Hooks, Vertical & Horizontal Hung","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":89.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/518pUAv1cdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【STAINLESS STEEL METAL FRAME】Metal frame is sturdy and strong, and the moisture-proof and oxidation-resistant material adds to its durability and adaptability to different surroundings. It sustains the effects of temperature and humidity. 【MATTE FINISHED TEXTURE】Contemporary finished texture adds extra protection to its surface from scratches. The pieces of the frame are welded together with mature edge sealing craft. Fine workmanship provides super-safety and stability. 【7 LAYERS HIGH-QUALITY MATERIALS】The surface of the bathroom wall mirror is shatter-proof, preventing glass flying and the back is sealed tight with a Medium Density Fibreboard, resisting dust, water, vibration. Wall mount mirror is copper-free without toxic odor, safe for children and pets. In addition, there are built-in waterproof, thermal-protective and anti-blackening layers, providing a higher environmentally friendly and longer service life. 【DELICATE DESIGN】HOWOFURN rectangular wall mirror create a harmonious blend of modern minimalism and classic black with no extra decoration. The matte frame surface brings a lasting and soft luster, combined with stream linear frame and round-corner, creating a sense of elegance and grace. 【MIRROR STRUCTURE】Glass floats in the frame deep 1.25\" surrounded by a thin 0.53\" gap which highlight the mirror area, making it easier to match different styles, such as rustic, vintage, or ornate room. 【RECTANGULAR HD SILVER MIRROR】Smooth 6mm float silver glass reflects an authentic and clear image without deformation. It is recessed into the frame and floated from the frame edges. Rectangle shape and the protective thin skirt frame create a sense of majestic and order, extending visual space, depth, and light. Not only can it better show your figure, but also there is no other fancy decoration which affects the overall view, helping you dress yourself every day. 【WIDE APPLICATION】 24*36 one-piece HOWOFURN wall mirror is carefree of assembling. The gourd hooks provide allow hanging horizontally or vertically. The package contains 4 screws, an instruction manual, and a ONE-YEAR WARRANTY. 【WHOLE SERVICE】We add reinforced materials to the outer box to ensure you receive a perfect package. Attentive customer service will accompany you throughout the whole process of buying and using, providing you guidance, install tips, or gift-giving advice.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/518pUAv1cdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HOWOFURN","source_asin":"B0928VYWL6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-769166","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0928VYWL6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0928VYWL6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
