window.products.push({"id":769233,"name":"Big Drinking Straws Reusable 13\" Extra Long 8mm Extra Wide Food-Grade 18/8 Stainless Steel Silicone Elbows Tips for Smoothie Milkshake Cocktail Juice ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61CupVIRgZL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","description":"Straight straw is made of food grade 18/8 stainless steel, elbow is made of food grade silicone, innoxious, no peculiar smell, BPA-free, reusable and durable Eco-Friendly design. Removable soft silicone elbow protect lips and teeth, make it more comfortable to sip cold or hot drinks. Easy to clean and dishwasher safe. The straws come with a cleaning brush for fast, effective and hygiene manual cleaning. Our flexible design allows you to add silicone elbows at both ends of the stainless steel straw to elongate the straw when needed for taller tumblers or sippy cups, fits cups up to 14 inches tall. Package: 4 x 10.5\" Straight Straws + 4 x 3\" Silicone Elbows + 2 x 10\" Cleaning Brushes","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61CupVIRgZL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GFDesign","source_asin":"B07T94FL88","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-769233","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07T94FL88","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07T94FL88","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":769234,"name":"Neoprene Lunch Bag, Insulated Reusable Fashionable Lunch Box Tote | Highest Quality, Holds More and Insulates Better | Large [12.5\" x 12\" x 8\"] | Maca","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81z4jmQzACL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"◆Overview: VerCandy Wax Warmer proves to be the perfect choice. Wax heats up in minutes and is perfect for hard-to-remove hair on your legs, arms, or anywhere else.Available in 4 scents, including Chamomile, lavender, Tea Tree,Rose.The wax beans are formulated using the highest quality plant, resin, and mineral ingredients to create safe, high-performance wax beans. ◆How to use your Wax warmer: ①Clean the skin area that needs hair removal ②Heat up until the wax beans are completely melted(Adjust the dial to 185℉ for time-saving and fast melting, The warmer will stop working and light off when the temp to 185℉) then rotate the knob to the 110℉ for heat preservation(and it will start working and lighting again when temp under 110℉) ③Spread a layer of wax over the skin in the direction of hair growth ④Waiting for 5-8 seconds, then peel off the wax in the opposite direction of hair growth ⑤Clean up the residual wax over the skin with cleansing oil or baby oil ⑥Then drop some of the cleaning oil or baby oil to the pot and reheat until dissolving away the wax residue ⑦Use paper towel to wipe away any residue in the pot ◆Attention,Please: Test it on a small patch of skin first to make sure your skin is not overly sensitive to the wax Test the wax temperature on waist before applying Do not apply wax over cuts, burns, or wounds Do not use water or alcohol to clean up the residual wax over the skin after hair removal Soothe your skin with an aloe lotion to calm redness and irritation after waxing session Do not take a shower or exposure after hair removal ◆Package Include: 1 x Wax Heater(500 ml) 4 x Packs of Hard Beans(100g/pack) 10 x Applicator Sticks 1x User Manual","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81z4jmQzACL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TUKNON","source_asin":"B0164NKBSM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-769234","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0164NKBSM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0164NKBSM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
