window.products.push({"id":769305,"name":"Kitchen Sponge Holder + Brush Holder, Adhesive 2-in-1 Sink Caddy Storage Organizer, SUS304 Stainless Steel, Rustproof, No Drilling","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zOYg8y0QL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A Must have for your sink - 2-IN-1 stainless steel sponge brush holder! Very very special , there is two lines which make you adjust your rack height between the sink bottom as you like. Organize your sink accessories and cleaning utensils for easy access. Don’t misplace your kitchen sponge or OXO dish brush; Open wire design encourages the cleaning supplies to dry fully, minimizing bacteria growth. * It big enough to have room for a second item if you store sponge vertically. * It has one end open, suit for longer sponge, no need fold and take it easier. * The rack rests on the adhered tabs then it allows you to easily take it off if necessary when you're cleaning the sink. What You Get: 1 x Sponge Holder, 2 x Adhesive, 1 x User Manual(Sponge and Brush not included in package) please note: If the rack keeps falling off the bracket, the problem is you do not realize that you have to force the holder into the bracket that you stick onto the sink, once you get it in, it is not coming off for any reason. Do not only lay the holder on top of the hooks on the bracket. Where to use: ONLY stick on smooth hard surfaces. DON'T stick on painted walls or wallpapers as it will take off your paint or wallpapers. How to use: 1. Clean the area where the adhesive installed and dry. 2. Peel off the protective cover on the back, install the adhesive and press firmly to squeeze air out. 3. Wait 30 mins for the adhesive to set. 4. Hang the shelf on the hook. It can be used 3 years after installation. You have to push it in pretty hard for it to snap into place! How to remove: 1.You can use a hair dryer to heat the adhesive surface, then tear off the installed adhesive. Do not worry about the adhesive leaving any residue on the sink surface. 2.Just pull the rack out of the hook for cleaning.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zOYg8y0QL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"\"N/A\"","source_asin":"B08JGBPVG3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-769305","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08JGBPVG3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08JGBPVG3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
