window.products.push({"id":769361,"name":"HYOOLA Premium Red Heart Floating Candles - Love Shaped Candles - 1.8 Inch - 2 Hour - 15 Pack - European Made","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81QkIsWWmtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Enjoy a soft, warm, soothing glow from beautifully elegant candles with Hyoola Candle’s floating candles! Whether for a wedding or as decorative floating candles for centerpieces, these love red floating candles are the perfect slow, clean, burning solution. They are made with premium quality wax and lead-free cotton wicks. PRODUCT FEATURES - 2 hour burn time candles - 1.5” wide- Red- High grade EU slow mealting paraffin- Elegant shape and finish- Great as romantic bath or pool floating candles.- Available in 15 and 30 Pack HIGH VALUE CANDLES Everything you expect out of your candle and more! Our candles provide an ideal light that will create the perfect atmosphere in any setting you choose. Wonderful light source for personal use whether you want a dim glow for reading in the dark or use a few at once to create a supremely luminous environment. Our candles are also unscented to avoid any unwanted odors and smells in your own house. While it's burning or after you put it out the flame, your area will stay completely scentless. This is great for not only setting a great aura but to avoid potential allergic reactions. Made from the best materials, our candles make sure your environment is safe. High quality wax within a deluxe holder will ensure the utmost security to minimize accidents or anything outside of the glass catching on fire. That wax itself melts slowly to provide minimal residue. ELEGANT PRESENTATION Our candles are beautifully designed so they can provide the best visual aesthetic for any situation. Ignite your creativity with Hyoola Candles ! Great quality materials mixed with incredible utility will brighten up your days!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81QkIsWWmtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hyoola","source_asin":"B07Q55NWCH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-769361","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07Q55NWCH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07Q55NWCH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
