window.products.push({"id":769378,"name":"Bath & Body Works Fresh Balsam 3 Wick Candle 2014","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61SDJ2ao2yL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"1 X Bath & Body Works Fresh Balsam 3 Wick Candle 2014","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61SDJ2ao2yL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bath & Body Works","source_asin":"B00OQMBJ8U","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-769378","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00OQMBJ8U","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00OQMBJ8U","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":769379,"name":"WILLOW WEAVE from USA 24\" Fireplace Grates Non-Assembly Wood Stove Grate Rack Heavy Duty Solid Steel Stove Burning Rack 10-Bars Firewood Holder Fire G","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51D2PskzhVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The WILLOW WEAVE fireplace grate holds well to daily use for many winters, helps with log burning efficiency. The wood log holder captures the embers above the fireplace floor leading to intense heat for BTU generation and ease of “tending the fire”. With this grate you literally just through a log on the fire once you get those embers glowing and each log burns evenly and consistently. The fireplace grate gets the fire up off the floor of fireplace, allows good airflow which means less time stoking the fire and more time enjoying the warmth and crackling. Preferred the flat 'bar' stock on this one as opposed to the square bar stock used for most because logs tend to stay put better. Perfect depth on the 'floor' of the grate allows 5-6 good sized logs. Most important, most other grates listed as 24-in only have four feet whereas this one 24” has eight, which means the long bars across the front and back won't sag in the middle over time like most. Tips to Purchase a Solid Perfect Fireplace Grate: a. Measure your firebox correctly, and ensure the grate fits, you may put two smaller grates in a larger firebox. b. When deciding on a grate with large spaces like other suppliers, keep in mind that too much air circulation can be as bad as not enough. If too much vent, not quite enough iron to keep hot embers near the wood... so fires are smoky and required a lot of those little starter bricks to create embers from the kindling and keep the wood hot enough to completely burn. c. Don't hesitate to save awesome bucks on WILLOW WEAVE fireplace grate, it wouldn’t let you down. If you need any assistance, please feel free to send message to us through your order.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51D2PskzhVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WILLOW WEAVE","source_asin":"B0BMFLK9KN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-769379","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BMFLK9KN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BMFLK9KN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":769380,"name":"Sensual Amber 3.7 oz. Scented Soy Melting Tart by Clover Valley Candles","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81yVz53fKoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This is a 100% soy wax tart that gives the aroma of golden amber, pink lotus petals, plum and creamy sandalwood all blended together in this awesome combination. Every Clover Valley Candles melting tart is individually hand poured and made from the highest quality of 100% Soy Wax and fragrance oils. Our candles and melting tarts are made in Duluth, Minnesota with attention to detail, pride and loving hands. Our soy wax melting tarts can be used with a tea light, halogen or incandescent bulb type of approved wax melter or tart warmers designed for melting scented wax. ** Our melting tarts were tested using a halogen bulb type melting tart wax warmer. **","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81yVz53fKoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Clover Valley Candles","source_asin":"B0083U1PV2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-769380","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0083U1PV2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0083U1PV2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":769381,"name":"Miele SEB 213-2 Midsize Power Nozzle (NON Direct Connect)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":199.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51PL2jyVhLL._AC_.jpg","description":"The Miele SEB213-2 Corded Powerbrush is an electric powerhead that fits the Miele S5 Series canister vacuums. This is a standard powerbrush with a pigtail cord. The Miele SEB213-2 is an electrically driven carpet tool with a 10 1/2\" wide brush roller, floating head design for various carpet heights and a swivel neck for excellent maneuverability. It is recommended for low to medium pile carpeting. The SEB 213-2 Powerbrush has an external cord clipped to the wand and is manually plugged into the electric hose. To supply the electricity for the motor, you also need an optional SES 113, SES 110, SES 105 or SES 100 electric hose. Note: This is a genuine replacement.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51PL2jyVhLL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Miele","source_asin":"B006M0IOFK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-769381","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B006M0IOFK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B006M0IOFK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
