window.products.push({"id":769537,"name":"Stainless Steel Lunch Box for Kids boys-Thermal Insulated Leak-proof 3 Compartment Students Bento Box is Ideal Portion Sizes for Ages 3 to 7-Ideal for","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71cHwUV0mvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Thermal technology】 The built-in water injection feature makes it easy to heat or cool. Simply add hot or cold water into the bottom basin before breakfast, lunch, or dinner！The bottom bowl is made of food grade PP and can also be used to hold fruits or salads. The lunch box itself does not have a long-term heat preservation effect, it needs to be added with hot water to achieve heat preservation, and the heat preservation time is about 1 hour. 【Leakproof】 Stainless steel compartment is not separate seal.We understand that you need a sealed bento box to carry your lunch. We use a sealing material design for the stainless steel layer of the lunch box to ensure that it is 100% water-proof when you bring your own lunch. But the bento box's PP bottom basin can’t be sealed when water is added, so no water can be added when carrying it. 【Safe Food Grade Material】 The students lunch box is made of PP food grade preservation material and the 304 stainless steel container which meet the requirements of food safety certification. High temperature resistant, durable, non-toxic, tasteless, all materials are BPA free. Enjoy your warm & healthier homemade food. 【Split design】The reusable lunch container has a split design for easy cleaning odorless, safe, eco-friendly, easy to wash. This lunch box has a large capacity of 1200ml, and the recommended age is 3-7 years old. Use for school, outdoor, travel, preschool daycare lunch, camping, portable outdoor. 【Widely applicable】The bento box has easy-open latches for your toddler small hands, and three separate large compartments, which can conveniently store various types of food and snacks, and separate vegetables, fruits and snacks to preserve the food original taste.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71cHwUV0mvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TUNCHMO","source_asin":"B09K3B6XQB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-769537","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09K3B6XQB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09K3B6XQB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
