window.products.push({"id":769674,"name":"QuikCLOSET - The Original Foldable Collapsible Wall Mounted Clothes Drying Rack - Space Saving Closet Organizer​","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":44.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71f+YB9v0rL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"At QuikCLOSET, we strive to find creative solutions for challenges caused by large clothing storage and small hanging space. We also wanted to create a compact clothing rack that’s not only functional but attractive when not in use. The QuikCLOSET is the answer to all your clothing organization problems. Use the QuikCLOSET to store or cycle seasonal clothes, like coats, sweaters, and jackets. This foldable drying rack can be easily installed on any wall. Use it on brick, concrete, and wood framed walls! This original patented design can be used indoors or outdoors. Put it in your laundry room, bedroom, guest room, utility room, or closet. After drying your clothes, you can hang them up on the QuikCLOSET to reduce wrinkles. The QuikCLOSET is also great for air-drying wet clothes. Air-drying certain fabrics helps preserve the material, extending the use of that particular article of clothing. Sometimes you just want to freshen your clothes outside; well, the QuikCLOSET can be installed for outdoor use! The QuikCLOSET is made up of 2 InstaHangers that are connected with a stainless steel rod. Because the rod is made from stainless steel, it will resist rust and corrosion. If you’d like, you can use the InstaHangers individually instead of combining them. With your purchase, you’ll receive a mounting template and hardware. You’ll get 6 yellow masonry anchors for brick and concrete walls and 6 Phillips wood screws for wood. When closed, the QuikCLOSET measures at 18” H x 36” – 60” W x 1 1/4” D. When opened, it measures at 18” H x 36” – 60” W x 14” D. You’ll get 3’ to 5’ of instant clothes storage with the QuikCLOSET. If you use the InstaHangers independently, you’ll get 12” each of hanging space. The steel rod has a diameter of 1/4”. The white ABS plastic of the QuikCLOSET is flexible, with smooth rounded corners for your safety, and does not require any floor space. The QuikCLOSET is the perfect size for small apartments! Order this space saver today!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71f+YB9v0rL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"QuikCLOSET","source_asin":"B000KM4Z5O","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-769674","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000KM4Z5O","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000KM4Z5O","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
