window.products.push({"id":769677,"name":"Hyde Lane Blush Twin Bedding Sets, Quilt Blanket Summer Bedding,Lightweight Bedspreads Coverlet, All Season, 66x90 2 Piece (1 Quilt + 1 Sham)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81GYAF3cnhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The reversible solid color quilt offer a simple yet aesthetically pleasing look that is suitable for your bedroom, guest room, children's room, holiday house, dormitory, etc. Tips: Because of different electronic devices, the colors displayed on the screen may be different. BETTER HEALTHIER SLEEP: Our treated quilt filling is rated 99.9% in reducing bacteria and microorganism’s growth. Even after repeated washes our quilt will, stay fresh and clean while offering an all year consistent healthy allergy free sleep. MULTI-PURPOSE USAGE: Perfect coverlet quilt for all season use, great cool feeling for the hot weather, it can also be use in winter as an extra blanket. Order 1 set and use all season. Use as quilt, bedspread, blanket or bed cover. Set includes: 1 Coverlet: 66\"W x 90\"L, 1 Standard Sham: 20\"W x 26\"L + 0.5\"D EASY CARE: Easy to clean, Machine wash in cold water on gentle cycle and separately making sure it has free movement in washer. Tumble dry low remove promptly, do not iron or use bleach.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81GYAF3cnhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hyde Lane","source_asin":"B08VDNHCH3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-769677","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08VDNHCH3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08VDNHCH3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":769678,"name":"Airthereal Bundle | ADH50B Air Purifier and 2-pack Spare Replacement Filters, Day Dawning","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51THZAzHtGS._AC_SL1065_.jpg","description":"Includes 1 ADH50B Air Purifier + 2 Spare Replacement Filters TRUE HEPA FILTRATION: True HEPA Filter will help you breathe easier by removing particles as small as 0.3 microns. A human hair has a diameter of around 50 microns, so our filter can remove particles that are 500 times smaller than a human hair. SILENT OPERATION: Tired of lying in bed at night listening to the hum of your air purifier? No more! The max operating noise in sleep mode is a mere 22 decibels, making it even quieter than a whisper or a small public library. AROUND THE HOUSE: The ADH50B is so lightweight that you can simply unplug and move to wherever you spend the most time. There’s no need to pay extra for a bigger machine to purify your entire home when you can have super-clean air wherever you set up the purifier. Clean the air you breathe most by moving the air purifier to wherever you are located at the moment. FILTER CHANGE REMINDER: All air purifier filters will decrease after a few months of usage. Airthereal air purifiers come with a built-in filter change reminder so that you can continue to keep the air in your home in the cleanest condition.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51THZAzHtGS._AC_SL1065_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AIRTHEREAL","source_asin":"B08DKXSGR4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-769678","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08DKXSGR4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08DKXSGR4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":769679,"name":"Map of the Island of Haiti 1789, 16 by 20-Inch, Gold Ornate Frame","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1R+hDVs4XL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang piece in a gold ornate frame features a map of the Island of Haiti. Cartography is the art and science of making maps. Cartographers utilized several reformative measures to ensure more accurate and informative maps. They used measuring scales and marking important landmarks on the maps to make them more attractive and elaborate. In order to achieve these specifications, many map-makers embarked on extensive expeditions to substantiate accuracy. A 16x20 giclee print under acrylic in a gold ornate frame. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating museum quality fine art reproductions. The piece is printed on high quality, archival paper that is textured, making the piece really stand out. A clear acrylic facing is added to protect the print. The piece is fully assembled by professional framers and comes ready to hang.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1R+hDVs4XL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B00NV4T8EQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-769679","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00NV4T8EQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00NV4T8EQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
