window.products.push({"id":769797,"name":"OrganizeHQ Toothbrush Razor Holder Organizer for Shower or Mirror, Silicone Bathroom Gadgets, 2Pcs Soap Dish Dishes Drain Stand Saver Tray for Scrubbe","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61QuwF-hJZL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Looking for a sturdy bathroom organizer to neatly organize your toothbrush, toothpaste and razor shaverhen OrganizeHQ toothbrush and razor holder for bathroom mirrors or shower walls is the perfect organizer. Requires NO adhesive or drilling to install it. Included in this set are soap dish for shower or bathtub and adhesive transparent wall hooks for hanging scrubbers or sponges. Both the toothbrush and soap holders are made using silicone material that is waterproof and has drainage holes that allow water to drain and keep them dry. What's included and product dimensions: 1 x Toothbrush razor holder - 8 x 5.5 x 1.5 inches 2 x Soap dish holder - 4.45x3.07x0.79 Inches 3 x Adhesive wall hooks - 2.36 x 2.36 x 0.31 inches VERY EASY TO INSTALL Toothbrush holder wall mounted installation: Clean and dry surface before installation. (Surface must be a mirror or shower wall and smooth such as marble or tiles else this will not stick) Peel off the transparent cover on the back and stick it to the surface (You can remove and reuse it simply by taking it off the surface, rinse with water, and use elsewhere) Adhesive wall hooks installation: Clean and dry surface (tile, ceramic, wood, or plastic surface) before installation (DO NOT install hooks on wallpaper, painted or plaster walls, or where it will be exposed to direct sunlight or temperature above 90 degrees) Peel off the transparent cover on the back and stick it to the surface Wait 24hrs before use (These hanging hooks are reusable. To remove them just use a hair dryer, heat around the transparent area and gently pull on the hook to remove it) These bathroom gadgets are the right choice.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61QuwF-hJZL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OrganizeHQ","source_asin":"B08TF8NX66","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-769797","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08TF8NX66","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08TF8NX66","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
