window.products.push({"id":769865,"name":"Organic Tea Gift Set with Portable Kettle - 25 Piece Tea Lovers Gift Basket | Birthday Gift for Women or Men | Present for Mom Mother, Teacher, Friend","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":69.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/619o15+bvHL._SL1024_.jpg","description":"[The Ultimate Tea Gift Set] - Treat yourself, a friend, or a loved one to the ultimate tea experience with this all-in-one gift set. It includes everything a tea lover could need and more, all conveniently packaged in a satin gift bag with a gift tag. The set includes a curated selection of 10 different organic teas, honey sticks, a double insulated tea mug, a portable kettle, and tea accessories. Everything you need for the perfect cuppa! [Portable Kettle] - Take your hot beverage game to the next level with our portable travel tea kettle! Whether you're at home, in the office or on the go, this fantastic kettle allows you to boil water anywhere and at any time. Simply fill it up with water (below the max line) and within minutes, you'll have steaming hot water ready to make a delicious cup of tea, coffee, soup or hot chocolate. A unique and thoughtful gift that will be appreciated by any tea or coffee lover. [Stainless Steel Teacup] - Sip in style with our 12 oz double-layered vacuum insulated stainless steel teacup! Keep your tea hot or cold for up to 3 hours with this premium teacup that is designed to preserve the temperature of your beverage. The BPA-free sliding seal lid ensures that you can take your tea on the go without any spills. And when you're done, cleaning is a breeze as it is dishwasher safe. An upgraded tea-time experience for any tea lover! [Delicious Honey Sticks] – Our USA-sourced organic Grade-A honey sticks are wrapped up with a gift ribbon and add a touch of elegance and class to your deluxe tea gift set. [Variety of Organic Teas] - This gift set includes a sampler of 10 different flavors of organic teas for you to discover and enjoy. From Jasmine Green, Mint, Masala Chai, Earl Grey, Hibiscus Berry, Lemongrass, Chamomile, Green, Black & Vanilla Rooibos Organic Teatulia Tea, you will find a flavor that suits your taste. Each tea is carefully selected and blended to deliver the best taste and aroma. Perfect for tea enthusiasts, or anyone looking to try a variety of teas. [Tea Accessories] - Elevate your tea experience with our stainless steel tea tongs and teapot tea coaster are included in this set to elevate your tea drinking experience. These high-quality accessories are designed to make handling and serving your tea effortless and enjoyable, ensuring that every sip is a memorable one. [Personalize your Gift] - Make your gift even more special by adding a personal touch with our custom gift message option. During checkout, you can enter a gift message, which will be included with your gift, along with the satin gift bag and gift tag. [Multi-purpose Satin Bag] - The reusable satin gift bag included in this set is not just for gift wrapping, it's also a versatile accessory for travel, home organization, and more. The soft satin material provides a touch of elegance and protects your delicate clothes, shoes, cosmetics, or other items from scratches, dust or damage. The drawstring closure keeps your belongings secure! A great addition to any gift or a practical item to have on hand. [Perfect for any occasion] - Elegant and thoughtful gift for any occasion birthdays, get well, self-care, Christmas, Mother's or Father's Day, teacher appreciation, housewarming, co-workers, nurses, graduation, Valentines Day, and more!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/619o15+bvHL._SL1024_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"What-a-Surprize","source_asin":"B0BQ3QFRFN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-769865","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BQ3QFRFN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BQ3QFRFN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
