window.products.push({"id":769970,"name":"STAR'S TRIP All-Season King Comforter Down Alternative Duvet Insert, Quilted Box Stitching Reversible Stand Alone Comforter with Corner Tabs, Soft Flu","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/810HtERXvDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"WHOLE PIECE FILLING: 300 gsm stand-alone microfiber filling with brushed fabric surface creates a premium high-quality bed comforter. It has good air circulation, which is suitable for year-round usage. The breathable and lightweight comforter offers a cozy and heavenly sleeping experience for you. BOX STITCHING: The bed comforter is quilted box-stitching. It can effectively prevent siliconized fiber filling from clumping, ripping, shifting, and leaking. The cotton filling also gets better support from the sewing side, so the comforter looks fluffy. The box pattern is classic and suitable for all bedroom styles. CORNER TABS: It's a king size reversible comforter(102\"x90\"), so both sides of it are white. You can use it alone because the brushed fabric is soft and comfortable. If you want to use a bed sheet to protect the premium comforter, we designed 8 built-in corners and side loops to secure bedding sheets. NOTICE: Our comforter comes in compressed packaging. When you receive this bed comforter, put it in the drier on low or place it in the sun for 1-2 hours. Gently pat the comforter to restore it to fluffy and soft. Enjoy your sound sleep with our cozy comforter. EASY CARE: Machine washes in cold water and tumbles dry at low temperature. Please clean it with a gentle cycle to extend the duvet comforter's service life. Do not iron, do not dry clean, do not bleach. Our comforter will not have any shrink or faded situation under normal conditions.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/810HtERXvDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"STAR'S TRIP","source_asin":"B098DQF2W3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-769970","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B098DQF2W3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B098DQF2W3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":769971,"name":"1000W 5-SPEED LCD Screen Centrifugal Juicer Machines Vegetable and Fruit, Healnitor Juice Extractor with Big Adjustable 3\" Big Mouth, Easy Clean, BPA-","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":89.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61J5P2+PcSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【5 Speed Modes for Different Fruits】\"1\" and \"2\" low speed for softer fruits like oranges, grapes, and tomatoes; \"3\" and \"4\" medium speed for harder fruits like apples, pears, peaches. \"5\" high speed for denser fruits and vegetables like carrots, celery, kale, and ginger. LCD monitor shows the speed more clearly and choosing the right speed for vegetables with different hardness will help to improve the juice yield. 【Maximize juice yield】Healnitor power juicer exactor equipped a strong motor with 1000watts, electric juicer can produce a large glass of juice in just a few seconds, it can easily separate the pulp and juice with a juice yield of up to 85% and easily separate the pulp and juice, providing about 30% more juice than traditional juicers. Enjoying a cup of fresh and healthy juice just in a few seconds. 【Safety Design & Overheat Protection】Large juicer has a safety lock design. If the lid is not locked properly, it will not work. Please read the manual, adjust the speed gear to \"0\" and properly clip the stainless steel safety arm lock to the juicer. The overload protection system will shut down the juicer if the motor overheats due to an unstable power supply, improper assembly, idling, etc. 【Shorten Pre-Time with Extra Wide Chute】The key to maintaining the taste of fresh juices is not to cut fruits and vegetables more than once. This ultra juicer is designed with 3-inch wide chute, you can juice a whole big apple or big tie celery without cutting and shorten your pre time.No pre-cutting is required, more convenient to use. Because of the efficient motor, you don't worry about clogging. 【Easy to Assemble and Clean】Juicer comes with 1L Juice Cup & 2.5L Pulp Cup extra large containers while being easy to assemble and disassemble in minutes, the juicer's clear lid, stainless steel filter bowl, neti plate, and pulp cup are all BPA free, you can put them in the dishwasher or clean them easily with the professional cleaning brush that comes with it.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61J5P2+PcSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Healnitor","source_asin":"B0C6F4JD9P","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-769971","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C6F4JD9P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C6F4JD9P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
