window.products.push({"id":769977,"name":"AHOLTA DESIGN Non-Iron Stain Resistant Thanksgiving Table Cloth – Cheap Table Cover Home Dining Room Table Protection - Christmas White Thanksgiving D","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81qJ3E+qfQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"WHAT YOU NEED: Are you tired of having to waste money and time on special cleaning products because your table cloths keep getting stained? Would you like a Christmas yet practical alternative for protecting your table surface? We have the solution! IRON-FREE: This elegant table cover doesn’t require any ironing and can be put into the washing machine and drier. The special fabric doesn’t wrinkle and dries out looking perfectly neat, saving you the time and effort. ELEGANT LOOK: Whether you’re using it in the comfort of your own dining room or for a fancy restaurant, this no spill table cloth will give an elegant sensation to any space. The beautiful patterns and 4 different colour options are great for special occasions and because of their resistant fabric you can even use it for giving your picnic a classy touch. DIMENSIONS AND SHAPES: This Cheap table cloth comes in 3 different shapes, so you can choose the one that suits your needs: square 52in, square 60 in, square 70 Inches, rectangular 52x70, rectangle 60x84, rectangle 60x104, rectangle 60x120, rectangle 60x140 Inches for big tables and round 52, 60, 70, 96 inches. With these many options, it is impossible not to find the right one! QUALITY. This fall dining table tablecloth from AHOLTA DESIGN are made from high-quality material. This polyester is spot-proof, easy to wash and doesn’t need ironing (please check reviews of other listings). The round, square, and rectangle tablecloths are machine washable.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81qJ3E+qfQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AHOLTA DESIGN","source_asin":"B075C3CR1G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-769977","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B075C3CR1G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B075C3CR1G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
